:db/id #edb/ref 17592186368490}] :question/id #uuid "55021539-024c-5816-9b9c-0adaf5b9e403" :question/math-academy-id "q-36049" :question/problem "Find the cofactor of ${c}_{21}$ in  $C=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 0 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -7 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we get the minor corresponding to ${c}_{21}$, removing the $2$nd row and the $1$st column:\n\n$$\nC=\\begin{bmatrix}∗ & 2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & ∗ & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ ∗ & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{21}=\\begin{vmatrix}2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{vmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the cofactor of ${c}_{21}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{21} & =(-1)^{2+1}{M}_{21} \\\\  & =-{M}_{21} \\\\  & =-\\begin{vmatrix}2 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{vmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186388188 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "32af6844-5246-5136-9000-3ee064ffc19f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}8 & 2 & \\sqrt{3} & -2 \\\\ 3 & 0 & \\sqrt{7} & 1 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 11 & 0 & -9 & 11\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388190} {:answer/id #uuid "d737f210-dea9-5f09-a66e-aa69dee797b6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "|\\begin{aligned}8 & 0 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -8 & -5 & -4 \\\\ 4 & \\sqrt{5} & 3 & 3 \\\\ 11 & 3 & 0 & 11\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388191} {:answer/id #uuid "b8de215d-f356-52db-9dfe-292de5b13226" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-|\\begin{aligned}8 & 0 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -8 & -5 & -4 \\\\ 4 & \\sqrt{5} & 3 & 3 \\\\ 11 & 3 & 0 & 11\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186388192} {:answer/id #uuid "792dcc1e-8af6-5018-a2ca-9221df1a6e4f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-|\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -8 & -5 & -4 \\\\ 4 & \\sqrt{5} & 8 & 3 \\\\ 11 & 3 & 0 & 11\\end{aligned}|" :db/id #edb/ref 17